      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "network.post",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "Docker sandbox workspaces are typically mounted via **virtiofs** (file sync between the host and Linux VM). Native Go and Rust binaries (esbuild, lightningcss, rollup, etc.) crash with mmap alignment failures when executed from virtiofs on aarch64. The fix is to install on the container's local ext4 filesystem and symlink back into the workspace.",
